ce=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F13.40.54ea79\">13.40.54ea79</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240605083513&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Quest_9c6d9d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a sugar.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.20 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can find <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sugar Cubes</strong> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Feyrist\">Feyrist</a> located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33422,32215,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33422, 32215, 8)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33495,32285,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33495, 32285, 8)</a>, and lastly in the cave <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33554,32212,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33554, 32212, 7)</a>, which is found one floor below <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33570,32186,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33570, 32186, 9)</a>. The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sugar Cubes</strong> are used in part of the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest - Sweet Dreams</a> when making the different sirups for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key\">Gingerbread Key</a>. \n</p><p><b>Note</b>: While you're on this part of the quest you'll be able to collect the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">sugar cubes</strong> from each of the chests 1x every hour until completing this task. This will allow you to make extras of the three different sirups:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Lemon Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Lemon_Sirup_ee8ccd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\">Flask with Lemon Sirup</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Moon Melon Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Moon_Melon_Sirup_a285bb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\">Flask with Moon Melon Sirup</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Raspberry Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Raspberry_Sirup_1fe673.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\">Flask with Raspberry Sirup</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trade